    "detailed_description": "It's time to learn about the dangers of the wasteland. You've trained all your life to be one of the captains.<br>The council of elders has given you your first serious assignment. You must lead your people through the wastelands.<br>For the first time, you get access to 3rd  level of technology. Which gives you access to vehicles, allows you to explore further terrain.<br>You need to prepare the necessary equipment and resoruces.<br>The wasteland awaits.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/66f405763f1dbe826a76984a0352435a.poster.avif?t=1728241360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/66f405763f1dbe826a76984a0352435a.webm?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/66f405763f1dbe826a76984a0352435a.mp4?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Restore civilization on the ashes of the fallen world! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/1793e612167d254011e59e7f7bbf2da5.poster.avif?t=1728241360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/1793e612167d254011e59e7f7bbf2da5.webm?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/1793e612167d254011e59e7f7bbf2da5.mp4?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Scavenge and gather for resources, everything counts! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/391eeb9aa0a181c3bae165eebe1d950c.poster.avif?t=1728241360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/391eeb9aa0a181c3bae165eebe1d950c.webm?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/391eeb9aa0a181c3bae165eebe1d950c.mp4?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Build and manage city of survivors after a apocalypse. Take care of every aspect of life. Gather, build, farm, upgrade, win ! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/069d817db75bd3a1174258b1637094c3.poster.avif?t=1728241360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/069d817db75bd3a1174258b1637094c3.webm?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/069d817db75bd3a1174258b1637094c3.mp4?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore wastelands to gather resources, protect and take care of your people!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/20c18eb0df9d72a500c651eb86b1de0e.poster.avif?t=1728241360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/20c18eb0df9d72a500c651eb86b1de0e.webm?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130380/extras/20c18eb0df9d72a500c651eb86b1de0e.mp4?t=1728241360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Fight off raiders, wild tribesman and natural disasters.",
